Vendored from commit 1e1a863761f742e8d509d569382b17c112e29fdc.

Changes for Bazzite Horizon:
- theme.conf: Bazzite wallpaper as the background, 12-hour clock.
- assets/avatar.jpg (the author's picture) and assets/background.jpg are not
  included. Users without a face icon get the first letter of their name.
- Main.qml: the avatar reads SDDM's IconRole (Qt.UserRole + 4; upstream reads
  + 3, HomeDirRole, so it always fell back to the missing assets/avatar.jpg).
  It shows FacesDir/<user>.face.icon, ~/.face.icon or the AccountsService
  icon, as SDDM picks them, and skips SDDM's generic faces/.face.icon.
- Not included: install.sh, flake.*, screenshots.
